{"slug":"gh-r-r","ar":"غ ر ر","total":27,"core":"deception; delusion","forms":[{"ar":"غَرَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":15,"gloss":"to deceive, delude","word":null,"ex":{"s":82,"a":6,"p":4,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","مَا","غَرَّكَ","بِرَبِّكَ","ٱلْكَرِيمِ"],"en":"O mankind, what has deceived you concerning your Lord, the Generous"}},{"ar":"غُرُور","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"delusion, deception","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":120,"p":7,"ar":["يَعِدُهُمْ","وَيُمَنِّيهِمْ ۖ","وَمَا","يَعِدُهُمُ","ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","إِلَّا","غُرُورًا"],"en":"Satan promises them and arouses desire in them. But Satan does not promise them except delusion"}},{"ar":"غَرُور","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"deceiver","word":null,"ex":{"s":35,"a":5,"p":14,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّاسُ","إِنَّ","وَعْدَ","ٱللَّهِ","حَقٌّ ۖ","فَلَا","تَغُرَّنَّكُمُ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","وَلَا","يَغُرَّنَّكُم","بِٱللَّهِ","ٱلْغَرُورُ"],"en":"O mankind, indeed the promise of Allah is truth, so let not the worldly life delude you and be not deceived about Allah by the Deceiver"}}],"surahs":[[35,4],[57,4],[3,3],[6,3],[31,3],[7,2],[4,1],[8,1],[17,1],[33,1],[40,1],[45,1],[67,1],[82,1]]}